cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the accompanying research manuscript."
title: "Cross-Controller Validity of Residual-Monitor Calibration in a PI-Controlled DC Motor"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Mei"
    given-names: "Jinghang"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-2901-3285"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/surnamemei/dc-motor-cross-controller-calibration"
abstract: >
  Research code and processed data supporting an experimental pilot study of
  cross-controller residual-monitor calibration validity in a PI-controlled
  DC motor. The public release supports statistical reproduction from derived
  data; original experimental MAT files and university teaching materials are
  not redistributed. Version 0.2.0 marks the archival closure of the pilot
  study and adds a separate record of later external-data assessments; the
  original manuscript, processed data and results are unchanged.
